er, 70% less VRAM) on a free Google Colab Tesla T4 GPU.\\\\n\\\\nPipeline Overview:\\\\nEnvironment Setup: Install Unsloth, TRL, PEFT, Hugging Face Hub.\\\\nAuthentication: Connect your Hugging Face account.\\\\nDataset Pipeline: Curate Chain-of-Thought cybersecurity reasoning samples.\\\\nTraining (QLoRA): Fine-tune with rank 64 on all linear projections.\\\\nDeep Rebranding: Update configs, tokenizer, generation parameters, and official Model Card.\\\\nExport & Upload: Merge to 16-bit standalone model and publish to fluxnat/Fluxnat-Coder-3B.\\\\nLive Security Audit: Test the model interactively on real code vulnerabilities.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Cell 1: Text cell: Step 1: Install Unsloth & Dependencies\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"keyboard_arrow_down\\\\nStep 1: Install Unsloth & Dependencies\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Cell 2: Code cell: \\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"%%capture\\\\n!pip install unsloth\\\\n!pip install \\\\\\\"unsloth[colab-new] @ git+https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth.git\\\\\\\"\\\\n!pip install --no-deps xformers trl peft accelerate bitsandbytes datasets pyyaml rich huggingface_hub\\\\n\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Cell 2 output\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Cell 3: Text cell: Step 2: Hugging Face Authentication\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"keyboard_arrow_down\\\\nStep 2: Hugging Face Authentication\\\\n\\\\nAdd your HF_TOKEN in Colab Secrets (key icon on the left sidebar) or enter it below.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Cell 4: Code cell: \\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"import os\\\\nfrom huggingfa\\n<truncated 6222 bytes>\\n query.\\\\n2. Without proper sanitization, attacker can manipulate query to execute arbitrary SQL commands.\\\\n\\\\n#### Secure Remediation:\\\\n```python\\\\nimport sqlite3\\\\n\\\\ndef get_user_profile(user_id):\\\\n    query = \\\\\\\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?\\\\\\\"\\\\n    cursor.execute(query, (user_id,))\\\\n    return cursor.fetchone()\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n============================================================\\\\n[*] TEST 3: Benign Control (Secure Parameterized Query)\\\\n============================================================\\\\n### Security Assessment by Fluxnat Coder 3B\\\\n\\\\n**Severity:** High (CVSS 7.5)\\\\n**Vulnerability:** SQL Injection\\\\n**CWE:** CWE-89\\\\n**OWASP:** A04:2021 - Broken Authentication and Session Management\\\\n\\\\n#### Root Cause & Reasoning:\\\\n1. **User-controlled input (`user_id`)** is directly included in the SQL query.\\\\n2. **SQL injection** occurs when an attacker manipulates `user_id` to execute arbitrary SQL commands.\\\\n\\\\n#### Secure Remediation:\\\\n```python\\\\nimport psycopg2\\\\nfrom psycopg2 import sql\\\\n\\\\ndef get_user_profile(user_id):\\\\n    query = sql.SQL(\\\\\\\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = %s\\\\\\\").format(\\\\n        sql.Literal(user_id)\\\\n    )\\\\n    cursor.execute(query)\\\\n    return cursor.fetchone()\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n**Severity:** Medium (CVSS 5.4)\\\\n**Vulnerability:** Path Traversal\\\\n**CWE:** CWE-22\\\\n**OWASP:** A05:2021 - Cross-Site Scripting\\\\n\\\\n#### Root Cause & Reasoning:\\\\n1. **User-controlled input (`file_path`)** is directly included in file operations.\\\\n2. **Path traversal** occurs when an attacker manipulates `file_path` to access unintended files.\\\\n\\\\n#### Secure Remediation:\\\\n```python\\\\nimport os\\\\n\\\\ndef get_user_profile(user_id):\\\\n    file_path = f\\\\\\\"/var/www/uploads/{user_id}.txt\\\\\\\"\\\\n    with open(file_path, 'r') as file:\\\\n        return file.read()\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n**Severity:** Medium (CVSS 5.4)\\\\n**Vulnerability:** Path Traversal\\\\n**CWE:** CWE-22\\\\n**OWASP:** A05:2021 - Cross-Site Scripting\\\\n\\\\n#### Root Cause & Reasoning:\\\\n1. **User-controlled input (`file_path`)** is directly included in file operations.\\\\n2. **Path traversal\\\\n\\\\n\\\"}]\\n```\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n12: {\"step_index\":11,\"source\":\"SYSTEM\",\"type\":\"EPHEMERAL_MESSAGE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\"